stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Idle
  Idle --> Editing: user types
  Editing --> Invalid: submit with errors
  Invalid --> Editing: user fixes field
  Editing --> Submitting: submit, client valid
  Submitting --> Success: 200 ok
  Submitting --> VerificationFailed: 400 verification_failed
  Submitting --> DeliveryFailed: 502 delivery_failed
  Submitting --> NetworkError: timeout / offline
  VerificationFailed --> Editing: reset Turnstile, retry
  DeliveryFailed --> Editing: retry
  NetworkError --> Editing: retry
  Success --> Idle: send another message
  Success --> [*]
